    "body": {
      "dataStream": "Architecture Decision Record\rOne decision per document. The value is not in the choice but in the why — that is what saves you from redoing the discussion a year from now.\rStatus\rProposed · Accepted · Superseded. If superseded, point to the one that replaced it.\rContext\rWhat forced the decision. Real constraints: deadline, team, cost, what already exists.\rDecision\r\rAlternatives considered\rWhat else was evaluated and why it lost. Discarding without recording invites the question to come back.\rConsequences\rWhat gets easier and what gets harder. Every decision charges a price — name yours.\r\n",
